.ll-lpv1-icon{display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;color:var(--color-primary)}
</style><header class="ll-lpv1-header" data-slot="header" role="banner"><div class="ll-lpv1-header__inner"><div class="ll-lpv1-header__brand"><img src="https://cdn.example.com/bepurex/logo.png" alt="Bepurex" class="ll-lpv1-header__logo" loading="eager"/></div><span class="ll-lpv1-header__tagline">Pharmacist-formulated wellness, delivered fresh.</span></div></header><main><div data-slot="hero"><section class="ll-hero"><div class="ll-container"><div class="ll-hero__grid"><div><p style="margin:0;color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:700">Bepurex</p><h1>The supplement stack pharmacists take themselves</h1><p style="font-size:1.25rem;color:#555">A clean, clinical-grade formula shipped straight from the lab — no middlemen, no fillers.</p><div style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="ll-cta" href="#offer" data-cta-variant="a" data-urgency="scarcity">Order the launch batch</a></div></div><div class="ll-hero__image"><img src="https://cdn.example.com/bepurex/hero.jpg" alt="The supplement stack pharmacists take themselves" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" width="1200" height="800" srcSet="https://cdn.example.com/bepurex/hero-600.jpg 600w, https://cdn.example.com/bepurex/hero-1200.jpg 1200w, https://cdn.example.com/bepurex/hero-1920.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw"/></div></div></div></section></div><div data-slot="benefits"><section class="ll-section"><div class="ll-container"><h2>Inside every bottle</h2><ul class="ll-bullets"><li class="ll-bullet"><span class="ll-bullet__dot"></span><span>Vitamin B12 (methylcobalamin) — 1000 mcg</span></li><li class="ll-bullet"><span class="ll-bullet__dot"></span><span>Iron bisglycinate — 25 mg (gentle on the stomach)</span></li><li class="ll-bullet"><span class="ll-bullet__dot"></span><span>Vitamin D3 — 2000 IU</span></li></ul></div></section></div><section class="ll-lpv1-timeline" data-slot="how_it_works"><div class="ll-container"><h2 style="text-align:center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles ll-lpv1-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg> <!-- -->How it works</h2><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__grid"><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__step"><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__label">Week 1</div><p class="ll-lpv1-timeline__desc">Take daily. First energy shift.</p></div><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__step"><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__label">Week 2</div><p class="ll-lpv1-timeline__desc">Consistency = compounding results.</p></div><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__step"><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__label">Week 6</div><p class="ll-lpv1-timeline__desc">Visible, lasting change.</p></div><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__step"><div class="ll-lpv1-timeline__label">Week 10+</div><p class="ll-lpv1-timeline__desc">Your new baseline.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="ll-section" data-slot="doctors_endorsement"><div class="ll-container"><div class="ll-lpv1-doctors"><h2>What pharmacists say</h2><p>Bepurex uses the exact bioavailable forms I recommend to my own clients — methylcobalamin over cyanocobalamin, bisglycinate over sulfate. That is rare in this category.</p><div class="ll-lpv1-doctors__author"><span>Dr. Anna Ferrari<span class="ll-lpv1-doctors__creds">PharmD, MSc Clinical Nutrition — University of Milan</span></span></div></div></div></section><section class="ll-section" data-slot="bundles" id="bundles"><div class="ll-container"><h2 style="text-align:center">Choose your bundle</h2><div class="ll-lpv1-bundles"><article class="ll-lpv1-bundle" data-bundle-index="0" aria-labelledby="ll-lpv1-bundle-h-0"><h3 id="ll-lpv1-bundle-h-0" class="ll-lpv1-bundle__name">Starter · 1 bottle</h3><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__desc">30-day supply</p><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__price">EUR 34.95<span class="ll-lpv1-bundle__compare">EUR 44.95</span></p><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__unit">60<!-- --> units</p><a href="#offer" class="ll-cta" aria-label="Order the launch batch — Starter · 1 bottle">Order the launch batch</a></article><article class="ll-lpv1-bundle ll-lpv1-bundle--popular" data-bundle-index="1" data-bundle-highlight="popular" aria-labelledby="ll-lpv1-bundle-h-1"><div class="ll-lpv1-bundle__badge">Most popular</div><h3 id="ll-lpv1-bundle-h-1" class="ll-lpv1-bundle__name">Popular · 2 bottles</h3><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__desc">60-day supply</p><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__price">EUR 62.95<span class="ll-lpv1-bundle__compare">EUR 89.90</span></p><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__unit">120<!-- --> units</p><a href="#offer" class="ll-cta" aria-label="Order the launch batch — Popular · 2 bottles">Order the launch batch</a></article><article class="ll-lpv1-bundle ll-lpv1-bundle--best" data-bundle-index="2" data-bundle-highlight="best" aria-labelledby="ll-lpv1-bundle-h-2"><div class="ll-lpv1-bundle__badge">Best value</div><h3 id="ll-lpv1-bundle-h-2" class="ll-lpv1-bundle__name">Best value · 3 bottles</h3><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__desc">90-day supply + free gift</p><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__price">EUR 84.95<span class="ll-lpv1-bundle__compare">EUR 134.85</span></p><p class="ll-lpv1-bundle__unit">180<!-- --> units</p><a href="#offer" class="ll-cta" aria-label="Order the launch batch — Best value · 3 bottles">Order the launch batch</a></article></div></div></section><div data-slot="reviews"><section class="ll-section" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.03)"><div class="ll-container"><h2>Trusted by 12,000+ customers</h2><blockquote class="ll-testimonial"><p style="margin:0">“<!-- -->I got my energy back within two weeks. No jitters, no crash.<!-- -->”</p><p class="ll-testimonial__source">— <!-- -->Sofia R.</p></blockquote><blockquote class="ll-testimonial"><p style="margin:0">“<!-- -->Finally a supplement that respects my digestion.<!-- -->”</p><p class="ll-testimonial__source">— <!-- -->Marco B.</p></blockquote></div></section></div><div data-slot="trust_badges"><div class="ll-container"><div class="ll-badges"><img src="https://cdn.example.com/badges/gmp.png" alt="GMP certified" loading="lazy"/><img src="https://cdn.example.com/badges/vegan.png" alt="Vegan formula" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div><div data-slot="dynamic_extras"><div data-block-id="dynamic-stats-0" data-block-kind="stats"><section class="ll-section"><div class="ll-container"><h2>By the numbers</h2><div class="ll-stats"><div><span class="ll-stat__value">12k+</span><span>Customers</span></div><div><span class="ll-stat__value">4.8/5</span><span>Trustpilot</span></div><div><span class="ll-stat__value">&lt;2%</span><span>Refund rate</span></div></div></div></section></div></div><div data-slot="guarantee"><section class="ll-section"><div class="ll-container"><div class="ll-guarantee"><h2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check ll-lpv1-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg> <!-- -->60-day peace of mind</h2><p>If you do not feel better within 60 days, ship the bottles back — full refund, no questions.</p></div></div></section></div><div data-slot="faq"><section class="ll-section ll-faq"><div class="ll-container"><h2>Frequently asked</h2><details><summary>When will I feel the difference?</summary><p style="margin-top:0.5rem">Most people report a noticeable lift within 10–14 days.</p></details><details><summary>Is it safe with medications?</summary><p style="margin-top:0.5rem">Consult your GP if you take blood thinners or thyroid drugs.</p></details></div></section></div><section class="ll-section" data-slot="cta_footer"><div class="ll-container ll-cta-block"><h2><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check ll-lpv1-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg> Ready to start?</h2><div style="display:flex;gap:var(--ll-space-sm);justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:var(--ll-space-md)"><a class="ll-cta" href="#offer" data-cta-variant="a" data-urgency="scarcity">Order the launch batch</a><a class="ll-cta ll-cta--secondary" href="#offer" data-cta-variant="b">Read the ingredient dossier</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="ll-lpv1-legal" data-slot="legal" role="contentinfo"><div class="ll-lpv1-legal__inner"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Bepurex<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p>Statements have not been evaluated by any medical authority. Not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p></div></footer><div data-slot="tracking" data-tracking-placeholder="true" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="ll-sticky-cta"><div class="ll-sticky-cta__inner"><span class="ll-sticky-cta__price">Free shipping · 60-day refund</span><a href="#offer" class="ll-sticky-cta__btn">Order now — EUR 69,95</a></div></div></div>